Z||000001||Cheever2||03-27-2001||11:27 AM||||Cool.  Welcome to the Forum.  Do you currently have any Fiero owner acquaintences, or are you a lone wolf?  There is a small pack of people here who know these are more than just cars, but the rest just get that stupid look on their face when you try to wave at them.  Lone Star Fieros is mostly older, laid back folk but know their stuff and love these cars.  FieroMike recently moved here from Colorado, I met him the other day.  He's younger but knowledgeable about Fieros too.  We're here for whatever you need.  There are some Forum members in Austin and San Antonio too.  Let's get together sometime.<P>Ha, looked at your profile *after* I submitted that reply, and of course we already know each other.  Enjoyed meeting with you & Mike the other day.  So the above statements will be for the benefit of others, heheh.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 03-27-2001).]||||reg||6
